Description: An R package for exploring and analysing lobbying organisations
    across Europe through EU-LOB, an open and continuously expanding database.
    It brings together organisations identified through their registration in
    lobbying or transparency registers, or through publicly documented
    meetings with institutional representatives, at European, national, and
    regional levels. The package enables researchers to search, identify, and
    compare organisations across different sources and jurisdictions. It
    incorporates exact and approximate name-matching methods, including cosine
    similarity, Jaccard similarity, Jaro-Winkler distance, and q-gram-based
    comparisons, to identify potentially matching organisations despite
    variations in names or spelling.
